[1.776435, "o", "✔ a text of the owner shows after the last shown message, also when the newest message was hidden (0.261565ms)\r\n"]
[1.776747, "o", "✔ mergeMessages skips a seq that it has, keeps the order of seq, and keeps the list when nothing is new (0.226718ms)\r\n"]
[1.777019, "o", "✔ the proxy forwards the two owner calls with the token, and refuses each other path (27.751811ms)\r\n"]
[1.777421, "o", "✔ the activity panel names each task that Petra started, in English and in Arabic, and each line has its data (0.577503ms)\r\n"]
[1.777807, "o", "✔ a watched task gives a line only when its state changes, and is not read again after it ended (0.465921ms)\r\n"]
[1.778091, "o", "✔ the proxy forwards the steps of one command, and refuses each other path under a command (1.331105ms)\r\n"]
[1.778424, "o", "✔ each internal step of Petra is one line with its data (0.457982ms)\r\n"]
[1.778793, "o", "✔ a watched command gives each step one time, also when a later read puts it in a new place, and stops when quiet (0.690627ms)\r\n"]
